  "label": "User projected onto the growth comparison scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the 'growth_comparison_scene' as the implied observer of the visual comparison of Harvey Price's physical development over time. The meme's framing invites the user to view the images as a personal narrative of growth, even though the text does not contain explicit deictic pronouns like 'you' or 'me'. The projection is implicit, as the user is positioned as the one interpreting the visual and textual material to understand the 'growth' narrative.",
